          "name": "Create Public Virtual Interface",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create Public Virtual Interface",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Creates a public virtual interface. A virtual interface is the VLAN that transports Direct Connect traffic. A public virtual interface supports sending traffic to public services of Amazon Web Services such as Amazon S3.</p> <p>When creating an IPv6 public virtual interface (<code>addressFamily</code> is <code>ipv6</code>), leave the <code>customer</code> and <code>amazon</code> address fields blank to use auto-assigned IPv6 space. Custom IPv6 addresses are not supported.</p>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
